# UX workflow: inspect summed pattern + per-step local random previews.
# Purpose: validates that resolved local step randomization is visually projected
# like pattern randomization for every supported musical dimension.
# Expect: capture_changed:summed_pitch_preview=summed_velocity_preview, capture_changed:summed_velocity_preview=summed_gate_preview, capture_changed:summed_gate_preview=summed_nudge_preview

0 scenario seq-local-random-summed-pitch
80 capture screen summed_pitch_preview

180 scenario seq-local-random-summed-velocity
260 capture screen summed_velocity_preview

360 scenario seq-local-random-summed-gate
440 capture screen summed_gate_preview

540 scenario seq-local-random-summed-nudge
620 capture screen summed_nudge_preview

# Exercise one real sequencer binding so workflow verification records dispatch.
720 tap MACRO_8 60
